        "sections": [
            {
                "content": "# Overview\n\nThe fixture workspace exists so the build pipeline can be rendered\nwithout reaching the network.\n\n- one context view\n- one container view\n- two decisions\n",
                "filename": "01-overview.md",
                "format": "Markdown",
                "order": 1,
                "title": "Overview"
            },
            {
                "content": "# Deployment\n\nThe fixture is served as a static site, or as one self-contained\nHTML document when `--single-file` is passed.\n",
                "filename": "02-deployment.md",
                "format": "Markdown",
                "order": 2,
                "title": "Deployment"
            }
        ],
        "decisions": [
            {
                "id": "1",
                "date": "2024-01-15T00:00:00Z",
                "format": "Markdown",
                "links": [],
                "status": "Accepted",
                "title": "Render diagrams in the browser",
                "content": "# 1. Render diagrams in the browser\n\nDate: 2024-01-15\n\n## Status\n\nAccepted\n\n## Context\n\nThe Structurizr renderer draws views client side.\n\n## Decision\n\nShip the renderer with the page.\n\n## Consequences\n\nNo server is needed to view a diagram.\n"
            },
            {
                "id": "2",
                "date": "2024-02-20T00:00:00Z",
                "format": "Markdown",
                "links": [
                    {
                        "id": "1",
                        "description": "Amends"
                    }
                ],
                "status": "Proposed",
                "title": "Inline every asset for single-file output",
                "content": "# 2. Inline every asset for single-file output\n\nDate: 2024-02-20\n\n## Status\n\nProposed\n\n## Context\n\nA self-contained document cannot make network requests.\n\n## Decision\n\nFold scripts, styles and images into the document.\n\n## Consequences\n\nThe document is larger, and works offline.\n"
            }
        ]
    },
